            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Kiŋit ŋes ekayaiton ediopet ebe, “Ekesisianakinan Iokajokan, keswama anyoika tetere erumi aijar naka ikar kere?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.18.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.18.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
